es</span></div> <!--[!--><!--]--> <ul class="reading-list-scroll" data-composable-scroll="reading-list" tabindex="0" aria-label="Reference volumes"><!--[--><li class="reading-list-item"><div><strong>Tensile Membranes &amp; Elastic Boundaries</strong> <div class="muted small">Frei Otto Institute, 1982</div></div> <span class="mono small">Vol. I</span></li><li class="reading-list-item"><div><strong>Active Thermal Envelopes in Modern Practice</strong> <div class="muted small">Banham &amp; Associates, 1999</div></div> <span class="mono small">Vol. II</span></li><li class="reading-list-item"><div><strong>Kinetic Morphologies: Computational Joinery</strong> <div class="muted small">Computational Architecture Press, 2021</div></div> <span class="mono small">Vol. III</span></li><li class="reading-list-item"><div><strong>Atmospheric Architecture &amp; Sensory Ecology</strong> <div class="muted small">Pallasmaa &amp; Zumthor Colloquium, 2025</div></div> <span class="mono small">Vol. IV</span></li><li class="reading-list-item"><div><strong>Pneumatic Structures: A Handbook</strong> <div class="muted small">Herzog, 1976</div></div> <span class="mono small">Vol. V</span></li><li class="reading-list-item"><div><strong>Soft Cities and Inflatable Commons</strong> <div class="muted small">Urban Membranes Review, 2023</div></div> <span class="mono small">Vol. VI</span></li><!--]--></ul></div></aside></div></main> <!--[!--><!--]--> <!--[!--><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!--]--><!----><!----><!----><!--]--><!----></div><!--]--><!--]--><!----><!----><!----><!----><!--]--><!----><!----><!----><!----><!--]--><!----> <footer class="app-footer"><span>Horizon Architecture Archive · Public collection 2026</span> <span>Images and texts © their respective studios</span></footer></div><!----><!--]-->
